    {
      "id": 220659,
      "name": "Jeysie",
      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-07-27T00:14:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What I wanna know now is who Jeysie's inside source with all that character inspiration knowledge is. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I have a knack for remembering bits of interesting information I see in convos or random articles (like the Marilyn Monroe story as well); part of why I was a pretty good secretary back in the day. :3</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Comrade Bubbles\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Comrade Bubbles:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Mist Storm hype!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I didn't think it was possible to get me more excited about Tactics Argent Adept, but Christopher's description of his and Tempest's playstyles somehow managed it nonetheless.</p>",
