      "raw": "[quote=\"TakeWalker\"]\n\nWhat I wanna know now is who Jeysie&#39;s inside source with all that character inspiration knowledge is. :O\n\n[/quote]\n\nI have a knack for remembering bits of interesting information I see in convos or random articles (like the Marilyn Monroe story as well); part of why I was a pretty good secretary back in the day. :3\n\n[quote=\"Comrade Bubbles\"]\n\nMist Storm hype!\n\n[/quote]\n\nI didn&#39;t think it was possible to get me more excited about Tactics Argent Adept, but Christopher&#39;s description of his and Tempest&#39;s playstyles somehow managed it nonetheless.\n",
